  "description": "F3 Convention (F3 or F3con) was a furry convention in Missouri and the state's first, first held December 14 to 16, 2012. It was a project of the Missouri's Furries group on FurAffinity, founded in early 2010 by Stitchfan, with Lung Ma as president and convention chair from 2011. Three editions were held, in Springfield and Branson, with Safari's Interactive Animal Sanctuary and the National Tiger Sanctuary among the charities. The fourth edition, planned for 2015, was not held, and the convention has been on hiatus since.",
